## YouTube Thumbnail Downloader

Our tool helps users retrieve and preview thumbnail images associated with YouTube videos.

Depending on the implementation, the tool may retrieve thumbnail images from YouTube's image delivery infrastructure using a video identifier derived from the supplied URL.

The tool does not grant ownership of these images or permission to reuse them.

If the tool processes URLs entirely in your browser, those URLs may not be sent to our own application server for processing. However, your browser may contact third-party services to retrieve images, and those services may process technical information such as your IP address.

Please verify the actual implementation before relying on any statement about browser-only processing or data storage.

